# Pricing Service Overview

Freight marketplace pricing microservice: quote shipments, freeze immutable snapshots on confirm, publish events for payment.

## Stack

- Python 3.12, FastAPI, PostgreSQL (`pricing` schema), Alembic, Redis Streams, pytest
- API prefix: `/api/v1/pricing`
- Health: `GET /health` (process up), `GET /ready` (Postgres reachable, else 503)
- No auth/JWT for this exercise

## Project layout

```
app/           # FastAPI app, domain, repositories
tests/         # pytest (unit + integration)
alembic/       # migrations for schema `pricing`
docs/          # spec (SPEC.md) + plans (plans/) — plan before coding
pyproject.toml
.env.example
README.md
```

## Hard constraints

- All money in **IRR as integers** — no floats, no `Decimal` for amounts
- Always: `driver_net_amount + commission_amount == gross_amount`
- Input validation: `distance_km > 0`, `stop_count >= 1`
- One snapshot per shipment (unique DB constraint)
- Skip: JWT, commission admin CRUD, event consumers, K8s/CI, payment integration

